    <screeningQuestions>
      <Value><![CDATA[]]></Value>
    </screeningQuestions>
    <seoDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[Dùng khi bạn sắp làm một việc và muốn kiểm tra trước, khi không có dấu hiệu nào rõ ràng, hoặc khi bạn thấy phân vân mà không gọi tên được vì sao.]]></Value>
    </seoDescription>
    <seoTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[Cách tự kiểm chứng trước khi đưa]]></Value>
    </seoTitle>
    <steps>
      <Value><![CDATA[[
  {
    "key": "b5b9684f-08df-597b-a5a3-b34a49f26bf1",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u1EBFt, ch\u1EADm l\u1EA1i. B\u1ED9 chuy\u00EAn \u0111\u1EC1 g\u1ECDi \u0111\u00E2y l\u00E0 b\u1ED1n vi\u1EC7c ph\u1EA3i l\u00E0m theo th\u1EE9 t\u1EF1: CH\u1EACM L\u1EA0I \u2014 X\u00C1C MINH \u0110\u1ED8C L\u1EACP \u2014 L\u00C0M R\u00D5 \u0110I\u1EC0U KI\u1EC6N \u2014 R\u1ED2I M\u1EDAI QUY\u1EBET.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "\u0110\u1EB7t \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i xu\u1ED1ng hai ph\u00FAt. T\u1EF1 tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi b\u1ED1n c\u00E2u: m\u00ECnh s\u1EAFp l\u00E0m g\u00EC, l\u00E0m v\u1EDBi ai, s\u1EBD h\u1ECFi l\u1EA1i \u1EDF \u0111\u00E2u, v\u00E0 c\u00F2n ch\u1ED7 n\u00E0o ch\u01B0a r\u00F5."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "8561bdcd-2343-58d4-a4e0-0782fd1d3cee",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "X\u00E1c minh b\u1EB1ng K\u00CANH CH\u00CDNH TH\u1EE8C \u2014 ngh\u0129a l\u00E0 n\u01A1i do ch\u00EDnh m\u00ECnh t\u1EF1 t\u00ECm ra.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "S\u1ED1 in tr\u00EAn th\u1EBB ng\u00E2n h\u00E0ng; \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng ch\u00EDnh m\u00ECnh \u0111\u00E3 t\u1EF1 c\u00E0i v\u00E0 v\u1EABn d\u00F9ng; \u0111\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 m\u00ECnh t\u1EF1 nh\u1EADp c\u00F3 t\u00EAn mi\u1EC1n k\u1EBFt th\u00FAc \u0111\u00FAng b\u1EB1ng .gov.vn; s\u1ED1 c\u00F4ng b\u1ED1 tr\u00EAn trang ch\u00EDnh th\u1EE9c; ho\u1EB7c c\u01A1 quan C\u00F4ng an n\u01A1i g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t.",
      "Kh\u00F4ng ph\u1EA3i s\u1ED1 m\u00E1y hay \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng d\u1EABn do ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kia \u0111\u01B0a. C\u0169ng kh\u00F4ng ph\u1EA3i s\u1ED1 l\u1EA5y t\u1EEB qu\u1EA3ng c\u00E1o hay t\u1EEB k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 t\u00ECm ki\u1EBFm \u0111\u1EA7u ti\u00EAn.",
      "N\u1EBFu ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kia c\u1EA3n b\u1EA1n l\u00E0m vi\u1EC7c n\u00E0y, b\u1EA1n \u0111\u00E3 c\u00F3 c\u00E2u tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "2438d1a8-4321-5d71-a915-77b7eb9e0a44",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "Xem m\u00ECnh \u0111ang \u1EDF l\u0129nh v\u1EF1c n\u00E0o, r\u1ED3i h\u1ECFi \u0111\u00FAng b\u1ED9 c\u00E2u h\u1ECFi c\u1EE7a l\u0129nh v\u1EF1c \u0111\u00F3.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "48e2f7dc-bce6-5028-ac6e-78afd533b4a5",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "C\u00F3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDDi g\u00F3p v\u1ED1n, \u0111\u1EA7u t\u01B0 \u2014 h\u1ECFi ba c\u00E2u: l\u1EE3i nhu\u1EADn \u1EDF \u0111\u00E2u ra, ai c\u00F3 ngh\u0129a v\u1EE5 tr\u1EA3 ti\u1EC1n cho m\u00ECnh, v\u00E0 mu\u1ED1n r\u00FAt th\u00EC r\u00FAt b\u1EB1ng c\u00E1ch n\u00E0o.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "Ch\u1EC9 d\u00F9ng s\u1ED1 ti\u1EC1n m\u00E0 n\u1EBFu m\u1EA5t th\u00EC \u0111\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng gia \u0111\u00ECnh v\u1EABn \u1ED5n. D\u1EEBng n\u1EBFu ph\u1EA3i vay, th\u1EBF ch\u1EA5p t\u00E0i s\u1EA3n thi\u1EBFt y\u1EBFu, ho\u1EB7c d\u00F9ng ti\u1EC1n d\u01B0\u1EE1ng gi\u00E0, ti\u1EC1n ch\u1EEFa b\u1EC7nh \u0111\u1EC3 g\u00F3p v\u1ED1n."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "926d0918-b8dc-59c4-abc7-dd20e6f41f15",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "C\u00F3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDDi vi\u1EC7c l\u00E0m, m\u1EDDi l\u00E0m th\u00EAm \u2014 h\u1ECFi s\u00E1u nh\u00F3m: chi\u1EC1u ti\u1EC1n, c\u00F4ng vi\u1EC7c, ai tuy\u1EC3n, tr\u1EA3 c\u00F4ng, gi\u1EA5y t\u1EDD, \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ra.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "Chi\u1EC1u ti\u1EC1n l\u00E0 c\u00E2u quan tr\u1ECDng nh\u1EA5t: vi\u1EC7c l\u00E0m th\u1EADt th\u00EC ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ta tr\u1EA3 ti\u1EC1n cho m\u00ECnh. H\u1EC5 b\u1ECB y\u00EAu c\u1EA7u n\u1ED9p ti\u1EC1n \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF vi\u1EC7c, m\u1EDF nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5, gi\u1EEF ch\u1ED7 hay b\u1EA3o \u0111\u1EA3m th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n c\u00F4ng vi\u1EC7c th\u00EC d\u1EEBng, v\u00E0 \u0111\u1EEBng n\u1ED9p th\u1EED."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "b431bb35-bcb5-551f-abf0-d2f107aac096",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "S\u1EAFp mua b\u00E1n, \u0111\u1EB7t c\u1ECDc \u2014 h\u1ECFi n\u0103m c\u00E2u: ti\u1EC1n v\u00E0o ai, m\u00ECnh nh\u1EADn g\u00EC, tr\u1EA3 qua \u0111\u00E2u, giao th\u1EBF n\u00E0o, ho\u00E0n tr\u1EA3 ra sao.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "94a8511f-98af-58ec-a405-3f84a49b159d",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "S\u1EAFp k\u00FD h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng \u2014 b\u1ED1n \u0111i\u1EC1u ph\u1EA3i r\u00F5 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi k\u00FD: ai l\u00E0 b\u00EAn cung c\u1EA5p, m\u00ECnh ph\u1EA3i tr\u1EA3 bao nhi\u00EAu, m\u00ECnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u01B0\u1EDFng g\u00EC, v\u00E0 mu\u1ED1n d\u1EEBng th\u00EC l\u00E0m th\u1EBF n\u00E0o.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "Xin to\u00E0n b\u1ED9 gi\u1EA5y t\u1EDD mang v\u1EC1 \u0111\u1ECDc. Kh\u00F4ng k\u00FD, kh\u00F4ng tr\u1EA3 ti\u1EC1n t\u1EA1i ch\u1ED7. C\u00F2n ch\u1ED7 quan tr\u1ECDng ch\u01B0a r\u00F5 th\u00EC ho\u00E3n k\u00FD."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "3c65eb34-5935-55ae-a82c-8002f7806503",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "S\u1EAFp vay ti\u1EC1n \u2014 ghi ra gi\u1EA5y ba con s\u1ED1: m\u00ECnh nh\u1EADn v\u1EC1 bao nhi\u00EAu, t\u1ED5ng c\u1ED9ng ph\u1EA3i tr\u1EA3 bao nhi\u00EAu, m\u1ED7i k\u1EF3 tr\u1EA3 bao nhi\u00EAu. R\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EB7t c\u1EA1nh thu nh\u1EADp v\u00E0 c\u00E1c kho\u1EA3n chi c\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFt c\u1EE7a gia \u0111\u00ECnh.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "0996079c-f1e8-570e-a4b8-a7f15324b96d",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "Cu\u1ED1i c\u00F9ng, ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t trong ba: HO\u00C3N, D\u1EEANG, ho\u1EB7c C\u00D3 TH\u1EC2 QUY\u1EBET \u0110\u1ECANH.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "HO\u00C3N l\u00E0 t\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EC3 h\u1ECFi th\u00EAm khi c\u00F2n thi\u1EBFu th\u00F4ng tin.",
      "D\u1EEANG l\u00E0 ng\u1EEBng h\u1EB3n khi g\u1EB7p y\u00EAu c\u1EA7u nguy hi\u1EC3m, ho\u1EB7c khi \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n kh\u00F4ng th\u1EC3 ch\u1EA5p nh\u1EADn.",
      "C\u00D3 TH\u1EC2 QUY\u1EBET \u0110\u1ECANH l\u00E0 khi \u0111\u00E3 \u0111\u1EE7 th\u00F4ng tin \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 quy\u1EBFt. \u0110\u00E2y l\u00E0 ba c\u00E1ch x\u1EED l\u00FD c\u1EE7a b\u1ED9 chuy\u00EAn \u0111\u1EC1."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "c0878430-6f1b-5191-a57e-caa930bc86c4",
    "isNotice": true,
    "mainText": "",
    "noticeTitle": "Quy t\u1EAFc d\u00F9ng cho m\u1ECDi tr\u01B0\u1EDDng h\u1EE3p c\u00F2n l\u1EA1i",
    "details": [],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": [],
    "snippetAfter": "umb://document/2553dcb3bd03593a99b81ac873c0f0f4"
  }
]]]></Value>
    </steps>
